fte fußläufig erreichbar\nWG-Leben:\n✔ Studierende, Berufstätige & internationale Mitbewohner herzlich willkommen\n✔ Keine Party-WG – ruhiges & respektvolles Zusammenleben\nSchreib mir mit kurzem Steckbrief: Name, Beruf/Studium, Einzugsdatum.\n\n🇬🇧 ROOM 1 – 13 m2 | €540 | ENGLISH\nAvailable: 1st June to 30th September | Extension possible thereafter\n\nModern & cozy room in a shared flat in Mering – just 30 minutes to Munich city center by train!\nWhether you're a professional commuting to Munich, a student at THA or Augsburg University, an intern, working student, or expat – if you're looking for a stress-free, fully equipped place to live near Munich, this is it.\nMove in straight away – no furniture shopping, no hidden costs.\n13 m2 room → €540/month All-Inclusive\n\nWhat's included?\n✔ Fully furnished room (bed, wardrobe, desk, chair)\n✔ Large shared kitchen with dining area\n✔ High-speed WiFi\n✔ All utilities (heating, electricity, water) – no hidden costs\n✔ Washing machine available\n✔ 2 bathrooms (1 large, 1 small)\nLocation – the highlight:\n✔ Mering St. Afra station: 10–15 min walk\n✔ Munich Hauptbahnhof: 30 min by train (2–3 trains per hour!)\n✔ TH Augsburg: 10 min | Augsburg University: 26 min\n✔ Supermarkets & daily amenities within walking distance\n✔ Mering is a quiet, green town just outside the city – the best of both worlds\nFlatmate situation:\n✔ Students, professionals & internationals very welcome\n✔ Not a party flat – quiet & respectful living expected\nSend me a short intro: your name, occupation/studies, and planned move-in date.","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"no"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"no"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"shared_w_both"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomSize":{"value":"13"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"no"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"